	<BaseGameText>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_TEMPLATE_NAME">
			<Text>Template</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_TEMPLATE_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>A forward-thinking civilization that values cultural development and strategic growth.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_CIVILIZATION_TEMPLATE_ADJECTIVE">
			<Text>Template</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_TEMPLATE_LEADER_NAME">
			<Text>Template Leader</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_LEADER_TEMPLATE_LEADER_QUOTE">
			<Text>"Progress is achieved through unity, vision, and the dedication of our people."</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_LOADING_INFO_LEADER_TEMPLATE_LEADER">
			<Text>An ambitious and visionary leader who guides their civilization toward prosperity. Through strategic planning and cultural advancement, they unite their people in pursuit of common goals. Their leadership emphasizes balanced growth, technological innovation, and cooperation with neighboring civilizations.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_TEMPLATE_LEADER_ABILITY_NAME">
			<Text>Strategic Vision</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_TEMPLATE_LEADER_ABILITY_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Cities gain +2 Loyalty and +15% Production toward Wonder construction. All units gain +5 Combat Strength. Strategic resources are revealed and provide +2 additional yields when improved.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_TEMPLATE_NAME">
			<Text>Cultural Heritage</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_TEMPLATE_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Citizens yield bonus Faith, Culture, and Gold per population. Begins with Astrology tech. Unique districts provide +2 Faith adjacency bonus and significant Housing and Amenities.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_BUILDING_TEMPLATE_NAME">
			<Text>Architectural Excellence</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_CIVILIZATION_BUILDING_TEMPLATE_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Unique buildings provide increased yields and housing. Buildings can be constructed more quickly and provide bonus amenities to cities.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DISTRICT_TEMPLATE_HOLY_SITE_NAME">
			<Text>Temple District</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_DISTRICT_TEMPLATE_HOLY_SITE_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Replaces the Holy Site. Generates Faith, Science, Production, and Food based on population assigned. A free Great Prophet appears on first construction.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_TEMPLATE_NAME">
			<Text>Elite Guard</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_TEMPLATE_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>A powerful melee unit with ranged attack capability. Stronger than comparable units of its era and unlocks special promotions through strategic resource research. Purchased with Faith.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_BELIEF_TEMPLATE_NAME">
			<Text>Shared Purpose</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_BELIEF_TEMPLATE_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Citizens gain bonus Yield in cities where this belief is prevalent.</Text>
		</Row>
