		<Row Tag="LOC_PROMOTION_TEMPLATE_UNIT_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Promotions available to the template unit class. Each promotion improves combat, movement, or ranged effectiveness.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_PROMOTION_TEMPLATE_ADVANCE_NAME">
			<Text>Rapid Deployment</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="LOC_PROMOTION_TEMPLATE_ADVANCE_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Grants increased mobility and allows the unit to ignore ranged penalties imposed by districts.</Text>
		</Row>
